msgstr "Whether to enable the SANITIZER."

msgid "ENABLE_PRINT_UB_BITS"
msgstr "ENABLE_PRINT_UB_BITS"

msgid "打开后可以获取当前UB占用量，给inductor使用。"
msgstr "Once opened, the current UB usage can be obtained for use by the inductor."

msgid "NPU_DEVICE_LIMIT"
msgstr "NPU_DEVICE_LIMIT"

msgid "用户设置算子运行时最大aicore和vector_core,格式要求：数字以,分割。比如：14,28。"
msgstr "Users set the operator's maximum aicore and vector_core at runtime, with the format requirement: numbers separated by commas. For example: 14,28."

msgid "无默认值"
msgstr "No default value."

msgid "**其他**"
msgstr "**Others**"

msgid "TRITON_BENCH_METHOD"
msgstr "TRITON_BENCH_METHOD"

msgid "使用昇腾NPU时，将`testing.py`中的`do_bench`切换为`do_bench_npu`（需配合`INDUCTOR_ASCEND_AGGRESSIVE_AUTOTUNE = 1`使用）。设为`default`时即使NPU可用，仍调用原`do_bench`函数。"
msgstr "When using Ascend NPU, switch `do_bench` in `testing.py` to `do_bench_npu` (requires `INDUCTOR_ASCEND_AGGRESSIVE_AUTOTUNE = 1`). When set to `default`, the original `do_bench` function is still called even if the NPU is available."

msgid "\"npu\"：切换为`do_bench_npu`"
msgstr "\"npu\": switch to `do_bench_npu`"

